<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-America Online downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-America Online downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp analyst Kenneth Leon said he downgraded America Online Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>Shares in the online computer company closed Tuesday off 3/16 at 73-11/16 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;Fair market value is always difficult to measure, but AOL is trading at very high p/e multiples, while earnings expectations have not risen as fast.... We would wait for a 15 to 20 percent correction before building a significant position,&quot; Leon said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
